// Shared across all build configurations. The Supabase publishable client
// configuration below is NOT a secret — it's designed to be embedded on-device (same
// as it was already hardcoded in Config.swift before this file existed). OpenAI's key
// and Supabase's service-role key are backend-only and never appear anywhere in this
// app. See docs/DEPLOYMENT.md's environment strategy for the full picture.
//
// Only one Supabase project exists today, so this value is currently identical across
// Debug/Staging/Release — if a separate staging Supabase project is created later,
// override INFOPLIST_KEY_SupabaseURL/SupabaseAnonKey in Staging.xcconfig instead of
// changing this file.
//
// NOTE: xcconfig treats `//` as a comment start, so URLs need the `$()` empty-macro
// trick below to keep the slashes from being swallowed.
INFOPLIST_KEY_SupabaseURL = https:$()//$()eqivixkkpkkxijbgaegl.supabase.co
INFOPLIST_KEY_SupabaseAnonKey = sb_publishable_41Hnq1oKebcUdKwE0f_EgA_SMbrLiWo
